<%= if @order.customer_first_name do %><%= gettext("Hi %{name},", name: @order.customer_first_name) %><% else %><%= gettext("Hi,") %><% end %>

<%= if @order.recipient_first_name do %><%= gettext("Your flowers for %{recipient} were delivered while nobody was home, so I left them in the spot shown in the attached photo.", recipient: @order.recipient_first_name) %><% else %><%= gettext("Nobody was home when I delivered your flowers, so I left them in the spot shown in the attached photo.") %><% end %>

<%= gettext("Thank you for your order. If anything isn't as it should be, just reply and I'll take care of it.") %>

<%= gettext("Warm wishes,") %>

Jennie
Eden Flowers
